OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 2 Sep to Fri 11 Sep
OL,6,FLikely remaining unsettled with most
OL,7,Fareas seeing some showers or longer
OL,8,Fspells of rain at times, with the main
OL,9,Ffocus for these across northern and
OL,10,Fwestern areas. Potential for some
OL,11,Fstrong and gusty winds at times. Some
OL,12,Fdrier and more settled interludes
OL,13,Fcould develop, perhaps becoming longer
OL,14,Fin duration across southern areas
OL,15,Flater in this period. Temperatures are
OL,16,Flikely to be near average, although
OL,17,Fsome short-lived warm or very warm
OL,18,Fspells are possible, especially in the
OL,19,Fsouth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
