OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1787928481
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 12 Sep to Sat 26 Sep
OL,6,FSignals are fairly limited from mid-
OL,7,FSeptember onward. At first, probably a
OL,8,Fcontinuation of a changeable regime
OL,9,Fwith the wettest conditions in the
OL,10,Fnorthwest and longer drier interludes
OL,11,Fin the southeast. However, the
OL,12,Fdistribution of rainfall soon becomes
OL,13,Fvery unclear, although compared to
OL,14,Fearlier in the month there is a
OL,15,Fgreater chance of more prolonged
OL,16,Fsettled/dry spells. Temperatures
OL,17,Flikely varying around average with
OL,18,Fsome warm spells likely, especially in
OL,19,Fthe south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
